Wu, what are you up to?

573
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,490
Such a lovely day today.

574
00:29:13,510 --> 00:29:14,700
I just slept in.

575
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:15,900
I was about to take a stroll.

576
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,250
You're getting better at acting.

577
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:20,660
You were out

578
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,700
drinking all night, right?

579
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:23,490
Wu.

580
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,770
You mustn't tell Mentor.

581
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:27,180
Or he'll punish me again.

582
00:29:27,400 --> 00:29:28,570
He made me do this

583
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:29,620
inside that circle

584
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:30,660
and forbade me from drinking

585
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,380
or even moving a bit.

586
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:32,770
- It was terrifying.
- Alright.

587
00:29:32,790 --> 00:29:33,250
That man...

588
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:33,810
Alright.

589
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:34,380
Sit down first.

590
00:29:36,070 --> 00:29:37,140
Really frightening.

591
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:38,420
Come on.

592
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:40,380
Here, have some tea.

593
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,050
To sober you up a bit.

594
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:45,490
I knew you treat me best.

595
00:29:46,590 --> 00:29:48,180
Mentor is busy
with outside affairs today.

596
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,570
He doesn't know
you weren't in your room.

597
00:29:50,790 --> 00:29:52,090
That's good.

598
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,330
But your drinking causes trouble.

599
00:29:54,350 --> 00:29:55,860
What if you cause some serious calamity?

600
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:56,770
Let alone me.

601
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:58,460
Even Mentor couldn't save you.

602
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,730
But I still have you.

603
00:29:59,750 --> 00:30:00,620
If not, I still have

604
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,140
all those seniors.

605
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,050
Jiu,

606
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:03,980
no matter what,

607
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,180
in the Ascendance Sect,

608
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,380
you count as an elder.

609
00:30:06,590 --> 00:30:07,490
Since you are an elder,

610
00:30:07,510 --> 00:30:10,090
you should shoulder that duty.

611
00:30:10,110 --> 00:30:12,220
But I'm your junior.

612
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,050
Problems like these

613
00:30:13,070 --> 00:30:14,530
are for my seniors to solve.

614
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:16,140
As for me, I should be carefree,

615
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:17,700
happy, easy, and at leisure.

616
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,570
Don't you agree?

617
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:19,090
You...

618
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,140
I think you should go to Jade Division.

619
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,900
Jade Division suits your temper.

620
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,490
You really get it.

621
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:26,570
Do you know how good

622
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:28,420
their wine is?

623
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:32,290
Those two at Jade Division...

624
00:30:33,030 --> 00:30:35,570
What immortal seedlings are they?

625
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:37,860
As for Ling'e, she's so clever

626
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:38,900
and utterly adorable.

627
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,770
As for Changshou...

628
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:43,940
That little frame looks so frail.

629
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:46,180
And he cannot touch girls.

630
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:47,660
He can foam at the mouth with one touch.

631
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:49,530
I wonder if he's cured by now.

632
00:30:50,030 --> 00:30:50,980
That sounds intense.

633
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:53,770
What is it, Wu?

634
00:30:55,590 --> 00:30:58,330
Qi Yuan called them immortal seedlings.

635
00:30:59,000 --> 00:30:59,980
He asked me

636
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,380
to look after them more.

637
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:02,290
No problem.

638
00:31:02,550 --> 00:31:04,180
If anyone dares bully those two,

639
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:05,660
I'll fly over and strike with my sword.

640
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,250
Alright, you win. Happy now?

641
00:31:07,590 --> 00:31:09,530
What I meant to say is

642
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:11,010
I'd like to bring these two

643
00:31:11,030 --> 00:31:12,330
to our Griefbane Division.

644
00:31:12,350 --> 00:31:13,090
What do you think?

645
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:14,140
I think it's a splendid idea.

646
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:15,090
You fetch them,

647
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:16,220
and I'll take charge
of their discipline.

648
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,050
You? Discipline them?

649
00:31:17,070 --> 00:31:18,010
How ridiculous.

650
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,050
Yes, I'll do the disciplining.

651
00:31:19,110 --> 00:31:20,420
And I swear,

652
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:22,570
I'm not just after their wine.

653
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:23,980
Speaking of wine,

654
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,530
something just came to mind.

655
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,180
What?

656
00:31:27,030 --> 00:31:28,530
To punish you, Mentor

657
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:29,530
ordered someone

658
00:31:29,550 --> 00:31:31,570
to go to your quarters

659
00:31:32,310 --> 00:31:33,620
and give away all your wine.

660
00:31:35,750 --> 00:31:38,380
I may have sinned greatly.

661
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,460
But it shouldn't go this far.

662
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:41,180
How can he give away my wine?

663
00:31:41,350 --> 00:31:42,660
Mentor, you white-haired old man!

664
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:44,380
- You're so mean!
- I knew you'd say that.

665
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:49,140
So,

666
00:31:49,830 --> 00:31:50,980
I hid a jar for you.

667
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:51,730
Where is it?

668
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:52,530
In the backyard.

669
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:58,460
That's more like it.

670
00:31:58,960 --> 00:31:59,730
I love you.

671
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,980
Remember: Don't let anyone see it.

672
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,770
Don't worry; it's fine.

673
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,660
Let me drink!

674
00:32:07,270 --> 00:32:08,330
Mentor!

675
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,220
Drinking again?

676
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,380
It has nothing to do with me.

677
00:32:22,830 --> 00:32:24,980
You're too cruel, Mentor.

678
00:32:25,460 --> 00:32:32,260
[Quarters for the Sea Deity Sect]

679
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:34,980
Everyone.

680
00:32:41,830 --> 00:32:43,380
Since you're not cultivators,

681
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,090
you cannot enter Ascendance Sect.

682
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:48,490
The Grandlord, understanding your quest,

683
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:50,620
has specially prepared food
and water for you.

684
00:32:51,750 --> 00:32:52,620
One serving of food per person.

685
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,770
Water is up ahead. Help yourselves.

686
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:54,530
Great!

687
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,490
Hand these out to everyone.

688
00:33:00,110 --> 00:33:02,090
So, Changgeng the Great

689
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:04,490
is renowned
across the cultivation world.

690
00:33:04,830 --> 00:33:06,570
So many have come for his name.

691
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:09,140
How did I not know before?

692
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:10,770
I was a frog in a well.

693
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,620
Of course, you knew nothing.

694
00:33:12,750 --> 00:33:13,900
It'd be odd if you did.

695
00:33:15,270 --> 00:33:16,700
Where did Senior Changshou go?

696
00:33:17,510 --> 00:33:20,050
He probably sought some quiet.

697
00:33:20,790 --> 00:33:21,770
I see.

698
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,860
Free from outside distractions,

699
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:25,420
he stays true to his heart.

700
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:28,570
Senior Changshou has taught me
another lesson.

701
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:31,090
Junior Ling'e.

702
00:33:31,350 --> 00:33:32,730
I'll return to cultivate first.

703
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:33,860
Alright.

704
00:33:37,680 --> 00:33:38,730
Ridiculous.

705
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,330
Today,

706
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,810
I will tell you a story

707
00:33:47,830 --> 00:33:49,900
about a famous tale of our sect

708
00:33:50,790 --> 00:33:52,900
between the Sea Deity
and the Dragon Maiden.

709
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:56,460
That day,

710
00:33:56,790 --> 00:33:57,620
the Sea Deity Changgeng...

711
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:58,460
Changgeng?

712
00:33:58,480 --> 00:33:59,730
was walking upon the surface of the sea.

713
00:34:00,260 --> 00:34:01,010
- My senior?
- Suddenly,

714
00:34:01,260 --> 00:34:02,200
in the distance, there was...

715
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,180
I won't listen! I won't listen!

716
00:34:03,240 --> 00:34:04,730
Senior could never be
that kind of person.

717
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:05,980
Impossible!

718
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,180
Let me tell you.

719
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:11,650
That carp spirit had
a truly captivating figure.

720
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,300
Sea Deity Changgeng

721
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,780
was burning with desire.

722
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,690
He tore off his clothes,

723
00:34:17,230 --> 00:34:20,460
revealing his muscular chest.

724
00:34:21,550 --> 00:34:22,740
This is not for children!

725
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:23,780
I'm not listening!

726
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,780
Absolutely impossible.

727
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,490
Senior is nothing
but a toad in the pond.

728
00:34:32,510 --> 00:34:33,980
No one would ever be with him.

729
00:34:49,110 --> 00:34:51,780
Oh, heavens! Oh, earth!

730
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,530
Impossible!

731
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,650
Blood again.

732
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,300
It's fine.

733
00:35:07,110 --> 00:35:07,900
I'm used to it.

734
00:35:08,070 --> 00:35:08,860
Mentor,

735
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,490
if I had your cultivation,

736
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:11,460
I'd be throwing up every day too.

737
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,570
Our sect

738
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,940
hasn't been this lively in ages.

739
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:24,690
Mentor, forgive my bluntness.

740
00:35:25,070 --> 00:35:27,170
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

741
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,490
The Elucidating Sect is
proud and arrogant.

742
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:30,170
The Seizing Sect is in disarray.

743
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:34,170
The Mermaid and Dragon Clans are linked.

744
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:35,380
When they're all here,

745
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:38,130
I've been busy

746
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:39,940
keeping order.

747
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,340
Exactly.

748
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:44,210
The Three Sects have long been at odds.

749
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,380
Yet we all came from one root.

750
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:50,050
And the Way we seek comes from one line.

751
00:35:51,150 --> 00:35:53,690
Why must we fight each other?

752
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:57,690
I have a dream.

753
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,260
One day,

754
00:36:00,630 --> 00:36:03,490
the Three Sects will drop their rifts

755
00:36:04,110 --> 00:36:05,170
and gather under one roof

756
00:36:05,590 --> 00:36:06,780
to cultivate the Way together.

757
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:07,570
We'll even

758
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:10,090
be united.

759
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,090
That

760
00:36:16,590 --> 00:36:17,570
would be good,

761
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:18,740
but

762
00:36:19,670 --> 00:36:20,420
is it possible?

763
00:36:22,030 --> 00:36:23,860
This is my dream,

764
00:36:24,590 --> 00:36:25,570
yet all this time,

765
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:27,610
I've been at a loss.

766
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:29,610
But now,

767
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:31,940
I see hope.

768
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:36,780
For the Three Sects
to put aside old grudges,

769
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:40,170
they must face a common enemy.

770
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,130
A common enemy?

771
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:43,980
I...

772
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:48,170
Your cultivation is too weak

773
00:36:48,190 --> 00:36:49,900
to tell from the divination.

774
00:36:50,510 --> 00:36:51,570
I don't blame you.

775
00:36:54,630 --> 00:36:57,300
Our sect has a destined fate.

776
00:36:58,110 --> 00:36:59,490
A thousand years after its founding,

777
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,610
it will face a great calamity.

778
00:37:01,630 --> 00:37:02,460
A great calamity?

779
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:03,380
What?

780
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,690
Since the founding of our sect,

781
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:08,300
it has been exactly a thousand years.

782
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:10,780
It's all right.

783
00:37:13,630 --> 00:37:15,050
When the great calamity comes,

784
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:17,050
it will be hard for us

785
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:19,420
to get through it alone.

786
00:37:19,710 --> 00:37:20,570
So, I had to let

787
00:37:20,590 --> 00:37:22,900
so many stay here.

788
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:25,780
Someone faced Tribulation
in the South Sea.

789
00:37:26,110 --> 00:37:27,300
Why did everyone

790
00:37:27,630 --> 00:37:29,780
end up here?

791
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:31,130
Don't you think

792
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:34,690
someone is setting this up?

793
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:36,820
Then,

794
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:38,490
do you mean

795
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:41,380
someone means harm to us?

796
00:37:43,590 --> 00:37:44,780
I can sense a new force

797
00:37:45,230 --> 00:37:47,530
rising beyond our walls,

798
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:51,050
though I don't know which force it is

799
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:53,170
or why it targets us.

800
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,650
But when the great calamity comes,

801
00:37:55,670 --> 00:37:57,170
faced with a fatal peril,

802
00:37:58,000 --> 00:38:00,650
I believe all the people present

803
00:38:01,230 --> 00:38:02,860
can surely set aside past differences

804
00:38:03,150 --> 00:38:04,380
and unite against the enemy.

805
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:07,690
I'll use our destined calamity

806
00:38:08,360 --> 00:38:11,260
as the start of Three Sects' unity.

807
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,170
Mentor,

808
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:17,860
thanks for your guidance.

809
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:21,690
Come on, it's your turn.

810
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:22,740
My turn.

811
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:28,260
Ready?

812
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,740
Ready.

813
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:35,260
Let's go.

814
00:38:46,920 --> 00:38:47,780
Sir.

815
00:38:48,230 --> 00:38:48,980
What's wrong?

816
00:38:49,070 --> 00:38:49,820
Nothing.

817
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,460
Good, then.

818
00:38:52,840 --> 00:38:53,650
Wang Qi?

819
00:38:57,760 --> 00:39:00,130
There are many Wang Qis here.

820
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:08,090
Sir,

821
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:09,740
which Wang Qi are you looking for?

822
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:11,570
I'm looking for Wang Qi
in Spiritkin Division.

823
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,170
Wang Qi from Spiritkin Division?

824
00:39:15,590 --> 00:39:16,420
Is it accurate?

825
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:19,170
Yes.

826
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:27,570
Liu Sizhe.

827
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,210
Sir, what brings you here?

828
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,010
You are Liu Sizhe, right?

829
00:39:37,070 --> 00:39:38,010
Yes.

830
00:39:38,440 --> 00:39:39,300
Please bestow your guidance.

831
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:42,530
Guidance is not mine to bestow.

832
00:39:42,630 --> 00:39:44,460
But if you insist, it's fine.

833
00:39:44,630 --> 00:39:45,860
Then I'll bestow first.

834
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:46,900
After that, you can call.

835
00:39:47,590 --> 00:39:48,050
Bestowed.

836
00:39:48,190 --> 00:39:48,650
Call!

837
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:56,860
Seniors.

838
00:39:57,070 --> 00:39:58,260
What are you doing here?

839
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:00,690
Junior.

840
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:02,820
Junior.

841
00:40:06,670 --> 00:40:09,130
Zhao Gongming, he's not human.

842
00:40:09,630 --> 00:40:10,940
What happened?

843
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:14,340
Oh, right, Junior.

844
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,980
Hurry to Jade Division! Save them!

845
00:40:28,630 --> 00:40:29,980
I'm here!

846
00:40:30,510 --> 00:40:31,780
Are you all waiting for me?

847
00:40:32,670 --> 00:40:33,490
Next.

848
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:36,260
Li Changshou of Jade Division.

849
00:40:40,070 --> 00:40:41,130
Elucidating Sect.

850
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:42,650
Seizing Sect.

851
00:40:43,510 --> 00:40:44,530
Mermaid Clan.

852
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,380
Bear Stockade.

853
00:40:49,110 --> 00:40:50,980
Westdawn Sect's goal is clear.

854
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,490
It's Changgeng.

855
00:40:53,840 --> 00:40:55,490
You still won't heed my plan.

856
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,130
Yunxiao.

857
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,050
Don't worry.

858
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,420
I won't force you.

859
00:41:01,550 --> 00:41:02,460
I trust you.

860
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:03,820
You have your own plan.

861
00:41:04,590 --> 00:41:05,570
Thank you, Yunxiao.

862
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,650
But you also promised me

863
00:41:08,150 --> 00:41:10,420
that you'd tell me every plan.

864
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,780
I'm waiting for someone.

865
00:41:15,230 --> 00:41:16,010
Waiting for someone?

866
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:18,300
To break Westdawn Sect's plot,

867
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,420
the safest plan

868
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:21,090
is still to send the Dragon Clan up

869
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,650
and let the Celestial Court step in.

870
00:41:23,760 --> 00:41:26,420
But the key figure

871
00:41:26,670 --> 00:41:27,740
is Ao Yi.

872
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:29,610
Yet the one he wants most to see

873
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:31,380
is Changgeng.

874
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:32,940
I see.

875
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,490
So, Westdawn Sect spread the rumor

876
00:41:34,510 --> 00:41:36,090
that Changgeng was at Ascendance Sect.

877
00:41:36,110 --> 00:41:37,170
And it worked in your favor.

878
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:39,210
You used it to bring Ao Yi here
to Ascendance Sect.

879
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,050
Once he shows up,

880
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:43,980
I'll let him be

881
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,610
the Tribulation bearer

882
00:41:45,630 --> 00:41:46,490
and help him build his name

883
00:41:46,550 --> 00:41:47,740
to lead the Dragon Clan.

884
00:41:48,110 --> 00:41:49,570
Then, he can go back
to the Dragon Palace

885
00:41:49,590 --> 00:41:50,900
to take the throne

886
00:41:51,230 --> 00:41:52,340
and, in turn, root out

887
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:54,340
the Westdawn members hidden there.

888
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:55,690
Yunxiao, you are truly wise.

889
00:41:55,840 --> 00:41:56,860
You saw through it at once.

890
00:41:58,190 --> 00:41:59,530
So, that's your plan.

891
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,940
Very well, I'll help you.

892
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,050
Thank you, Yunxiao.

893
00:42:04,190 --> 00:42:04,980
For now,

894
00:42:05,110 --> 00:42:06,610
I only need to stay quiet

895
00:42:06,630 --> 00:42:08,340
here in Jade Division

896
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,530
and wait for Ao Yi to show up.

897
00:42:10,960 --> 00:42:12,130
But aren't you worried

898
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,420
that Westdawn Sect will find you first?

899
00:42:15,150 --> 00:42:16,130
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

900
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,860
I've made thorough preparations.

901
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:19,260
I've withdrawn all paper butterflies.

902
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:21,420
Even if Westdawn Sect has immense power,

903
00:42:21,670 --> 00:42:23,820
they'll never discover my location.

904
00:43:01,320 --> 00:43:07,100
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

905
00:43:07,770 --> 00:43:14,470
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

906
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:22,050
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

907
00:43:22,680 --> 00:43:29,130
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

908
00:43:29,870 --> 00:43:36,990
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

909
00:43:37,370 --> 00:43:44,270
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

910
00:43:44,650 --> 00:43:52,000
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

911
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:59,170
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

912
00:44:15,310 --> 00:44:20,480
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

913
00:44:21,570 --> 00:44:28,590
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

914
00:44:29,780 --> 00:44:35,720
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

915
00:44:36,420 --> 00:44:43,500
♪Alas, our story is short♪

916
00:44:43,840 --> 00:44:50,950
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

917
00:44:51,270 --> 00:44:57,750
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

918
00:44:58,530 --> 00:45:05,740
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

919
00:45:06,130 --> 00:45:13,950
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
